{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the beginning of <i>UNEXTINCTION</i> \u2014 a cinematic dinosaur survival adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the <strong>first 10 minutes</strong> of the game, set entirely in the <strong>open ocean map</strong>. Witness the calm before the storm, explore your stranded vessel, and feel the eerie isolation of being alone at sea\u2026 until something massive stirs beneath the surface.<br><br>WHAT TO EXPECT</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a small section of the full game's world \u2014 the <strong>ocean environment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover atmospheric clues, stunning sea views, and narrative-driven moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes a key cinematic encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat, no dinosaurs to ride or feed \u2014 this is the <i>tension-building</i> opening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A teaser of the full story-driven experience coming soon in the full version<br><br>IMPORTANT NOTES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>demo</strong> of the early story section \u2014 visual quality, effects, and gameplay may change in the final game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime: ~8\u201310 minutes depending on exploration speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback and playtime help us shape the final game and improve its visibility on Steam!</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807780?t=1749871558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807780?t=1749871558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807780/d06f7f770947a4fa1ae6b0c523b146b6db01b4f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749871558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/380778